Attribution
-----------
Environmental measurements are obtained through the AirGradient Public API from
the national school climate monitoring network established in Lao PDR by UNICEF
with the Ministry of Education and Sports (MoES) and the Ministry of Natural
Resources and Environment (MoNRE). CHIP deploys no hardware of its own.

Third-party data sources referenced by the platform (integrated under the
funded workplan) include: MODIS/Landsat land surface temperature (NASA/USGS),
ERA5 reanalysis (ECMWF via Copernicus CDS), aggregate epidemiological case data
(DHIS2 and partner hospitals), and population/school data (Lao Statistics
Bureau). Each retains the licence attached to its source.
